Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main(void) {
    char text[4];
    int needed = snprintf(text, sizeof text, "%s", "hello");
    if (needed < 0) { return 1; }
    printf("%s %d\n", text, needed);
    return 0;
}

```

